Bundled documentation fonts
===========================

Noto Sans and Noto Sans Mono
  Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors
  (https://github.com/notofonts/latin-greek-cyrillic)
  SIL Open Font License 1.1 - full text in LICENSE.Noto

  Acquired 2026-08-09 from Google Fonts CSS for Noto Sans weights 300-700
  and Noto Sans Mono weights 400-700. The returned variable WOFF2 files were
  saved locally and remote URLs were replaced by relative paths in fonts.css.
  This directory contains these 15 WOFF2 files, totaling 757,252 bytes, so the
  standalone documentation remains self-contained and makes no network font
  request. The two Noto Sans SC files below are the only others.

